\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprite Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SFX Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Director</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>HalfAlieno:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art Director</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Writing Director</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marketing Lead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Italian Localization</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Selina Xu:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Background Artist</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Tate Osborne:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprite Artist\u00a0</p></li></ul>",
